Vendor logos in this directory come from @lobehub/icons-static-svg 1.95.1
(https://github.com/lobehub/lobe-icons), redistributed under the MIT License below.
The marks themselves remain trademarks of their respective owners; they are used
only to identify each provider.

Local modifications: <title>, width/height and inline style attributes removed;
kimi.svg recolours the white "K" to currentColor so it reads on light themes.
tokenrhythm.png is 基元律动's own favicon (token-rhythm-favicon-light.png,
https://tokenrhythm.studio, fetched 2026-10-24): the site ships it as a light and
a dark PNG whose alpha channels are identical, so we ship one file and let the
renderer colour it with currentColor via a CSS mask.

